msgctxt "cal_nc_edit_complex_last"
msgid ""
"You are editing event\n"
"%s\n"
"that is unable to be fully edited. New repeat rule must be set first. Any exception rules will be lost.\n"
"Continue?"
msgstr ""
"You are editing event\n"
"%s\n"
"that is unable பெறுநர் be fully edited. புதிய repeat விதி must be கணம் first. Any exception rules will be lost.\n"
"Continue?"

msgctxt "cal_nc_edit_complex_recurrence"
msgid ""
"You are changing a repeat rule for event\n"
"%s\n"
"that is unable to be fully edited. Any exception rules will be lost. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"You அரே changing a repeat விதி க்கு event\n"
" %s \n"
"அதை முழுமையாக திருத்த முடியவில்லை. விதிவிலக்கு விதிகள் அனைத்தும் இழக்கப்படும். தொடரவா?"

msgctxt "cal_nc_permanent_delete"
msgid "'%s' calendar can not be deleted. Delete all calendar content instead?"
